        "chinese": "关于它们。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 273000,
        "endMs": 278000,
        "english": "That's interesting. I went to a car museum last Sunday.",
        "chinese": "那也很有意思。我上周去了一家汽车博物馆。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 279000,
        "endMs": 283000,
        "english": "What did you see there?",
        "chinese": "你在那里看到什么了？"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 283000,
        "endMs": 287000,
        "english": "I saw a lot of interesting cars.",
        "chinese": "我看到了很多有趣的汽车。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 287000,
        "endMs": 291000,
        "english": "Did you buy anything at the car museum?",
