      },
      {
        "startMs": 318000,
        "endMs": 323000,
        "english": "There is a science museum in the city. It is big.",
        "chinese": "城市里有一个大科学博物馆。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 325000,
        "endMs": 329000,
        "english": "It opens at 10 o'clock in the morning every day.",
        "chinese": "每天早上十点钟打开。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 331000,
        "endMs": 337000,
        "english": "Last Saturday, Kitty and her brother Ben went to the museum.",
        "chinese": "上个星期六，凯蒂和她的哥哥本去了博物馆"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 339000,
        "endMs": 343000,
        "english": "They visited the world of robots on the second floor.",
        "chinese": "他们在二楼的机器人世界里参观过。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 345000,
        "endMs": 349000,
        "english": "They saw many kinds of robots there.",
        "chinese": "他们看到了各种各样的机器人。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 355000,
        "endMs": 358000,
        "english": "There was a robot at the piano.",
        "chinese": "在钢琴上有一台机器人。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 359000,
        "endMs": 364000,
        "english": "He could play songs. His fingers moved very fast.",
        "chinese": "他能唱歌。他的手指移动得很快。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 366000,
        "endMs": 372000,
        "english": "Kitty and Ben stood beside the piano and listened for half an hour.",
