      },
      {
        "startMs": 178000,
        "endMs": 181000,
        "english": "你是你是你是你是你是你?",
        "chinese": "你是你是你是你是你是你？"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 183000,
        "endMs": 184000,
        "english": "Look and read.",
        "chinese": "看看读。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 186000,
        "endMs": 188000,
        "english": "At the science museum",
        "chinese": "科学博物馆"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 190000,
        "endMs": 192000,
        "english": "There is a science museum in the city.",
        "chinese": "城市里有一座科学博物馆。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 193000,
        "endMs": 194000,
        "english": "It is big.",
        "chinese": "它很大。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 195000,
        "endMs": 199000,
        "english": "It opens at ten o'clock in the morning every day.",
        "chinese": "每天早上十点左右它都会打开。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 200000,
        "endMs": 204000,
        "english": "Last Saturday, Kitty and her brother Ben went to the museum.",
        "chinese": "上个星期六，凯蒂和她的哥哥本去了博物馆"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 205000,
        "endMs": 209000,
        "english": "They visited the world of robots on the second floor.",
        "chinese": "他们在二楼的机器人世界里参观过。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 210000,
        "endMs": 213000,
        "english": "They saw many kinds of robots there.",
        "chinese": "他们看到了各种各样的机器人。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 214000,
        "endMs": 216000,
        "english": "There was a robot at the piano.",
        "chinese": "在钢琴上有一台机器人。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 217000,
        "endMs": 218000,
        "english": "He could play songs.",
        "chinese": "他会唱歌。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 219000,
        "endMs": 221000,
        "english": "His fingers moved very fast.",
        "chinese": "他的手指移动很快。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 222000,
        "endMs": 227000,
        "english": "Kitty and Ben stood beside the piano and listened for half an hour.",
        "chinese": "凯蒂和本站在钢琴旁听了半个小时。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 228000,
        "endMs": 230000,
        "english": "Then they saw a robot dancer.",
        "chinese": "然后他们看到一个机器人舞者。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 231000,
        "endMs": 233000,
        "english": "He could move his head and arms.",
        "chinese": "他能动头和胳膊。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 234000,
        "endMs": 240000,
        "english": "Kitty and Ben also saw many other interesting robots in the museum.",
        "chinese": "凯蒂和本还看到了许多其他有趣的机器人。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 241000,
        "endMs": 243000,
        "english": "They had a great time there.",
        "chinese": "他们在那里玩得很开心。"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 246000,
        "endMs": 248000,
        "english": "Students' book, page 56",
        "chinese": "第56页学生课本"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 249000,
        "endMs": 252000,
        "english": "你是你是你是你是你?",
        "chinese": "你是你是你是你是你？"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 255000,
        "endMs": 257000,
        "english": "Listen and enjoy.",
        "chinese": "听歌谣并享受"
      },
      {
